            },
            "reviewBody": "Good :). Didn't know marshmallows were sold in a cream lol so, glad to find this as I had these ingredients except for the sour cream. But I did have an 8 oz. container of thick plain Greek yogurt which turns out has similar flavor to sour cream, and it turned out just fine.",
