              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "PARADISO"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Wow, really good!! Creamy, refreshing goodness; great choice over the usual party snacks. I used reduced-fat cream cheese and non-fat milk. Adding a touch more sugar is safe if serving with tart apples. Try putting a dash of cinnamon in a side bowl of it to see if you like that added flavor. Enjoy!",
            "datePublished": "2009-07-04T13:27:12.473Z"
