            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Robin"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I wanted a healthy snack that seems more decadent than perhaps it is. This dip, coupled with a generous plate of various bite-sized pieces of fruit, did the trick. SO delicious! I liked the recipe so much just as is, I was hesitant to add anything more (you know that old adage \"if it ain't broke don't fix it) However, after I got to delight in this delish snack for a couple days, I went ahead and dressed the last bit of it up with a shake of cinnamon. I'll do that from the start next time.",
            "datePublished": "2019-11-24T22:42:05.057Z"
          },
          {
