            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Simple, sweet but not too, great on any fruit for a sweet treat, and Bless YOU for a recipe without Marshmallow cream! Have hated that stuff since I was little. Love Marshmallows for campfires but that goop in a jar NO!! I prefer natural ingredients and real sugars to that goop any day.",
